      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The outside-view base rate is the ten-quarter first-print reference class from 2024-Q1 through 2026-Q2. Its calculated mean is 0.85%, median 0.8%, and range 0.7%-1.1%. The latest four-quarter mean is 0.775%, suggesting that the latest 0.9% print should receive partial persistence weight."
