      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The September earnings and hiring observations support a modest downward momentum adjustment. This is an inference: average hourly earnings are a separate wage proxy and are not substituted for the ECI target. No identified one-off warrants an additional adjustment. BLS says updated employment weights begin with December 2026 data, after this target quarter."
      },
      {
        "kind": "tool",
        "tool": "official.lookup",
        "call": "Fetch https://alfred.stlouisfed.org/series?seid=ECIWAG to verify the registered source binding.",
